    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><strong>Fractal Cross-Reference.</strong> You don’t read books—you triangulate between them.</p><ul><li><p>When you engage in <strong>downtime research</strong> about Sparks, Tikkun, factions, or hex Lore using multiple sources (archives, interviews, war logs, etc.), you reroll the lowest die on one<strong>Mind-based research check</strong> (GM chooses the skill) for that downtime period.</p></li><li><p>On a success, the GM may also grant <strong>one extra useful detail</strong> beyond what a normal success would have revealed.</p></li></ul>",
